    <description>Single-screen Reassign Supervisor flow (Jira MSADT-21). Primary and Temporary Supervisor are both Person Account lookups. Reassignment is bulk, by supervisor: every employee currently reporting to Primary Supervisor moves to Temporary Supervisor for the date window. Logic in SupervisorReassignmentAction / SupervisorReassignmentService. Embedded on the Supervisor Reassignment tab above an All Person Accounts list view - not a popup/modal.</description>
